# Environment variable template.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# docs/standards/configuration.md section 4 is the authority on what belongs in this file, how it
# is scoped, and what makes a change to it complete. The short version, at the point of work:
#   - This file IS committed and must stay complete.
#   - Real secrets never appear in it. Use obvious placeholders.
#   - Secrets have no defaults. A default credential is one that reaches production unnoticed.
#   - Adding a variable without adding it here is an incomplete change — the next person to
#     clone this repository cannot start the unit.
#
# PROJECT_TRIGGER [trigger: the first unit reads configuration]: add every variable that unit reads.
